          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-3-5-vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">Q Guidance System</span></span></span></h1>\r\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Advanced surgical planning and navigation platform&nbsp;for <br>\r\n cranial and spine procedures</span></span></p>\r\n",
