          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Pushing navigation forward<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Offers unmatched speed</li>\n<li>The flexibility of multiple optical tracking methods, including full-spectrum active/passive hybrid optical tracking<sup>1</sup></li>\n<li>Only guidance system/camera with proprietary active technology</li>\n<li>Designed for accurate re-registration using reference points</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Apr 13 2023 14:41:46 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
